        {
          "id": 1372733192,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Causes problems for the ubuntu build on Github.  \nThe commit modified `epan/dissectors/packet-lpp.c` but since its `asn1` the template should be updated instead?\n\n```\n[ 92%] Linking C shared library ../run/libwireshark.so\n/usr/bin/ld: dissectors/CMakeFiles/dissectors.dir/packet-lpp.c.o:./obj-x86_64-linux-gnu/epan/dissectors/./epan/dissectors/packet-lpp.c:5805: multiple definition of `units_dbhz'; CMakeFiles/epan.dir/unit_strings.c.o:./obj-x86_64-linux-gnu/epan/./epan/unit_strings.c:84: first defined here\ncollect2: error: ld returned 1 exit status\n```\n\n[asn1/lpp/packet-lpp-template.c](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/epan/dissectors/asn1/lpp/packet-lpp-template.c#L2049):  \n```\nconst unit_name_string units_dbhz = { \"dB-Hz\", NULL };\nconst unit_name_string units_pa = { \"Pa\", NULL };\n```",
